falls victim to fishing lines"

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.370
"A heron died, strangled by
a fishing line around its neck"

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.370
"Wild Bird Association: Please
take your fishing lines with you"

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:05.370
"Many demand better fishing etiquette"

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.370
"Save wild birds from fishing lines!"

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:07.370
"Rescued a heron from a fishing line"

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.080
"I saw a heron with a fishing line tangled
around its leg today. I felt really bad
because it looked so weakened."

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:23.450
Oh, President Kuroiwa.
Sorry to call you so late.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:29.370
All right. We're now gonna put our
"Capture the Heron" plan in motion.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.830
First, Tsurugi gets to say somethin'
since this was her bright idea.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.080
Huh?

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.450
O-Okay...

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:40.950
Um... I just felt really bad,
leaving the bird like that.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:45.370
There might be a lot of
other animals suffering like that,

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.620
but now that we saw that one,
I just can't leave it alone.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:53.790
I just couldn't enjoy fishing
leaving the bird in that state...

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:56.870
And, and...

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.500
Hina...

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.450
I just can't!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:05.910
I can't just leave any string
tangled up like that!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.950
I want to untangle it and get some relief!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.040
So that's what you're after?!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.250
I-It's true that I felt bad for it.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.000
President...

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.200
Don't we need permission from city hall
to actually catch a bird in the wild?

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.160
Huh? You do?

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.330
Don't worry. I went and got permission.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.580
And I also borrowed these.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.750
W-Wow, you're amazing, President.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:34.500
If it's hurt really bad, we can call them,
and they'll take the bird to a vet.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.040
Wow, they'll do all that?

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:40.200
All right! Now we just gotta catch that thing!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.790
It's hot! And it smells sorta fishy.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:48.500
Can we really catch it with this thing?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.450
Shut up. Don't move. It'll see us!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.000
It's here! It's here!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:04.160
It's the heron from yesterday!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:13.290
W-Wow, I caught one.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:13.540
"Fresh Blue Sprats"
W-Wow, I caught one.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.700
"Fresh Blue Sprats"
It sure looks tasty...

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.160
Hina...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.660
Man, she sucks.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:22.450
Come on. You want it? You do, don't you?

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.330
Here you go.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.370
Got it!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:35.040
--Ohno!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.290
--Right!
--Ohno!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:44.330
Tsurugi! Hurry up before it
panics and gets hurt more!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.080
O-Okay!

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.540
Hi-yah!

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:57.540
Thank goodness it's not that hurt.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.790
Y-Yes...

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:03.080
It just went through hell,
so it probably won't come back.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:03.910
You lonely?

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:07.950
Huh? Why? It doesn't need to come back.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.620
It just eats my fish and its eyes are creepy.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:18.540
Don't come back, you hear?! And don't
get all tangled up in fishing line again!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:38.580
Okay, I'm definitely going to...

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.660
It sure is tough.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.330
Today's haiku...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.830
"Protecting wildlife

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.290
means that you always clean up

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.790
and pick up your trash."

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:04.330
By Hina.
